NAME
    gcloud alpha service-health events - represents events that may affect
        Google Cloud products

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha service-health events COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Represents events that may affect Google Cloud products.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Get details of an event affecting a project.

     list
        (ALPHA) List events under a given project and location.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

